DECISIONS 213, TYPES.md §12.3: a value typed by a broken record is broken, so neither the record nor the value is refused again by the go and json emits (no E8012, no E8151).
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A mail.
record Mail {
  /// Its subject.
  subject: String
  /// A function.
  zzFn: fn(Int) -> Int
}

/// Every mail.
let mails: [Mail] = []

emit go { out: "@features/a", package: "a" }
emit json { out: "out/" }
-- findings.txt --
error[E3306]  a/a.canon:8:9
  a function type is not allowed here

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
